Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:04:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] user.exe16: network connections and error text, language
 functions

WNetAddConnection/CancelConnection and the connection dialogs call mpr with WNet error mapping; WNetGetError, WNetGetErrorText and WNetErrorText report the last error; the Win 3.x language functions work for the system language (MessageBoxEx, SetWindowTextEx, SetDlgItemTextEx, Load(System)LanguageString, code page queries).

Unverified: no 16 bit runtime or compiler is available here, so this is compile-checked only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

